-Radio Vault is a Windows application for listening to, researching and preserving large personal talk-radio archives. Version 0.28 rebuilds archive ingestion around a canonical **Broadcast → Recording → Physical File** model. Alpha3 remains a non-destructive shadow analysis and concentrates on proving that each broadcast contains the right recordings before any live migration is allowed.
